86
00:38:58,996 --> 00:39:03,316
もっかいじゃじゃじゃーん！ まだまだつづくよ？ みこのアイドルライブ
Once more, jajajaan! Still continuing? Miko's idol live!

87
00:39:04,236 --> 00:39:08,436
ついてきてるー？ （Everybody say yeah！） ここから舞い上がる
Are you keeping up? (Everybody say yeah!) Soaring up from here...

88
00:39:10,236 --> 00:39:15,116
推し活もはかどる みこのアイドルライブの掟！上級編！
...making oshikatsu even more productive! The rules of Miko's idol live! Advanced edition!

89
00:39:16,436 --> 00:39:22,636
(1)いっぱいコールに想いのせること！ (2)私の歌をハートに刻むこと！ (3)いつだって今を忘れないこと！
(1) Put your feelings into every cheer! (2) Etch my songs into your heart! (3) Never forget the present moment!

90
00:39:23,236 --> 00:39:26,436
全部できたら最高（オッケー！！） いつだってきゅんきゅんできればいいけど
If you can do all that, it's the best! (Okay!!) It would be great if we could always go kyun-kyun, but...

91
00:39:27,996 --> 00:39:32,436
迷っちゃいそうな夜もあるよ 推し変したって また惚れさせちゃうから
...there are nights when you might feel lost. Even if you oshi-hen, I'll make you fall for me all over again!

92
00:39:33,236 --> 00:39:36,636
いつでもみんなの居場所だよ アッパレード！
It's always everyone's place to belong. Apparade!

93
00:39:39,636 --> 00:39:42,316
もっとどこまでも照らしてこう せーのしゃしゃしゃしゃShine！
Let's illuminate even further everywhere! Ready, shashashasha Shine!

94
00:39:43,996 --> 00:39:49,116
夢中になって宙に舞え 咲き乱れぱれーど 月明り揺れて ふわふわ～
Get lost in a trance and dance through the air, blossoming in an Apparade! Moonlight swaying, fluffy~

95
00:39:49,596 --> 00:39:53,236
（ふわふわふわふわ！） ゆらり照らすその先は？ そうやっぱ それがMy Way！（Oh yeah！）
(Fluffy fluffy fluffy fluffy!) Where does that swaying light illuminate? Yes, as expected, that's my way! (Oh yeah!)

96
00:39:54,716 --> 00:40:00,116
あきらめやしないよ（ふっふっふー！） All right！（All right！） So bright！（So bright！） さぁ一歩一歩超えていこう
I won't give up! (fu-fu-fu!) All right! (All right!) So bright! (So bright!) Come on, let's overcome step by step!

97
00:40:01,244 --> 00:40:03,304
ゆらり照らすその先は？
What lies beyond that gentle glow?

98
00:40:03,304 --> 00:40:06,864
そうやっぱ それがMy Way！ あきらめやしないよ
Yes, of course, that is my way! I'm not going to give up!

99
00:40:08,344 --> 00:40:12,644
さぁ一歩一歩超えていこう ほら321のサインで
Come on, let's step forward one by one with the 3, 2, 1 sign!

100
00:40:12,644 --> 00:40:15,884
この先花吹雪 走っていこうニューステージ！
Running through the cherry blossom blizzard ahead to a new stage!

101
00:40:15,884 --> 00:40:20,364
ドキドキしちゃうな わっしょい！ さぁ一緒に行こう？
My heart is pounding, Wasshoi! Shall we go together?

102
00:40:22,764 --> 00:40:24,864
みこち！ はーい！
Mikochi! Yeah!

103
00:40:29,344 --> 00:40:31,821
もっともっと声を出して！
Let's hear your voices even louder!

104
00:40:34,804 --> 00:40:37,084
みんなで！これからも！ ずっとずっとアッパレード！
Everyone! From now on too, always keep the parade going!

105
00:40:38,244 --> 00:40:41,304
みこち！みこち！ LOVE！LOVE！みこち！
Mikochi! Mikochi! LOVE! LOVE! Mikochi!

106
00:40:41,304 --> 00:40:45,784
みこち！みこち！ きゅんきゅん みこち！
Mikochi! Mikochi! Kyun-kyun Mikochi!

107
00:40:48,224 --> 00:40:51,344
もっとどこまでも飛んでいこう せーのじゃじゃじゃじゃJUMP！
Let's fly anywhere further, ready, set, JUMP!

108
00:40:52,044 --> 00:40:55,784
夢中になって宙に舞え 咲き乱れぱれーど 太陽みたいにShiny！
Get lost in the dream and dance in the air, a blooming parade, shiny like the sun!

109
00:40:56,244 --> 00:40:59,124
ひらり軌跡描くように そうきっと それがMy Way！
Tracing a graceful trajectory, yes, surely that is my way!

110
00:40:59,124 --> 00:41:02,204
信じているんだよ All right！ So bright！
I believe in it! All right! So bright!

111
00:41:07,004 --> 00:41:09,464
信じているんだよ
I believe in it!

112
00:41:11,004 --> 00:41:14,124
さぁもっともっと声出して
Come on, let's voice it out even more!

113
00:41:14,944 --> 00:41:17,384
全力で輝け！
Shine with all your might!

114
00:41:21,204 --> 00:41:23,364
咲き誇れば嗚呼わっしょい！
Blooming proudly, ah, Wasshoi!

115
00:41:23,364 --> 00:41:26,484
さぁ一緒に行こう？ れっつごーっ！
Shall we go together? Let's go!

116
00:41:49,224 --> 00:41:51,804
いくよ？ きゅんきゅんみこきゅん？
Ready? Kyun-kyun Miko-kyun?

117
00:41:52,244 --> 00:41:55,104
（きゅんきゅんみこきゅん！） きゅんきゅんみこきゅん？
(Kyun-kyun Miko-kyun!) Kyun-kyun Miko-kyun?

